## Intelligent Branch Suggestions

### Feature Branch Naming
**AI analyzes:**
- Issue tracker integration (Jira, GitHub Issues)
- Current task description
- Project naming conventions
- Existing branch patterns

**Example:**
```
User: "I'm working on adding OAuth login"
AI: "Based on your description, I suggest:

feature/SK-234-oauth-authentication

This follows your project convention:
- Prefix: feature
- Ticket: SK-234 (found in issue tracker)
- Description: oauth-authentication (kebab-case)

Alternative suggestions:
- feature/auth-oauth2-login
- feature/SK-234-google-oauth

Which would you prefer?"
```

### Branch Cleanup Recommendations
**AI monitors:**
- Merged branches
- Stale branches (no activity > 30 days)
- Abandoned branches (no commits)

**Example:**
```
AI: "🧹 Branch cleanup recommendation:

Found 5 branches that can be safely deleted:
1. feature/SK-123-old-feature (merged 45 days ago)
2. bugfix/SK-456-timer-fix (merged 30 days ago)
3. experiment/new-ui (no commits, 60 days old)

Would you like me to:
1. Delete all merged branches
2. Review each branch individually
3. Keep all branches"
```

