## Cursor Command Patterns

### Git Command Syntax for Cursor

#### Natural Language Commands
```
"Create a feature branch for user authentication"
"Commit these changes with a proper message"
"Show me what changed in the last 3 commits"
"Create a PR for this feature"
"Help me resolve merge conflicts"
"Clean up my commit history"
"Push to remote after running tests"
```

#### Explicit Git Commands
```
"Run: git status"
"Execute: git log --oneline --graph"
"Show: git diff develop...HEAD"
```

#### Compound Operations
```
"Pull latest develop, create feature branch, and switch to it"
"Commit all changes, push, and create PR"
"Stash changes, switch branch, then pop stash"
```

