## Error Handling & Recovery

### Common Git Errors

#### Detached HEAD
```
AI: "⚠️ You're in 'detached HEAD' state

This means you're not on any branch. To recover:

Option 1: Create new branch from here
  git checkout -b feature/SK-999-recovery

Option 2: Return to previous branch
  git checkout develop

Option 3: Discard changes and return
  git checkout develop (changes will be lost)

What would you like to do?"
```

#### Failed Push
```
AI: "Push failed: Remote contains commits you don't have

Options to resolve:
1. Pull and merge (recommended)
   git pull origin feature/SK-123

2. Pull and rebase (cleaner history)
   git pull --rebase origin feature/SK-123

3. Force push (⚠️ dangerous, will overwrite remote)
   git push --force-with-lease

Which option would you prefer?"
```

#### Large File Error
```
AI: "🚨 Push rejected: File too large

Large files detected:
- video/demo.mp4 (150MB)
- dataset/training.csv (80MB)

These files should not be in Git. Would you like me to:
1. Remove files and add to .gitignore
2. Set up Git LFS for large files
3. Cancel push and handle manually

Note: I'll help you remove these from history if needed."
```

